  "note": "Issue 91 adds source-unit-keyed title/body-opening decisions for Volume 6 ordinals 7763-9484 through additive profile v9, preserves ordinal 9484 as one cross-volume entry while keeping its four preceding terminal structural segments distinct, and records the exact title-only units at ordinals 8282, 8357 and 9010. It advances the honorific formula registry to v1.7.0 with 86 reviewed exact Volume 6 source forms so quoted, damaged, named and structural devotional occurrences remain enforceable at the corresponding English occurrence rather than escaping inventory as unregistered contextual text. Packet-schema document v8 pins registry 1.7.0 to this v10 binding. Packet, shard, tool and stage-provenance data remain version 3.0.0; public-proposal v2, execution registry v2 and sol-xhigh-explicit-host-v1 remain unchanged. Earlier bindings, title profiles, schemas, proposals, releases and evidence retain their original immutable pins."
